*---------------------- EXTENDED HEADER FIELD
* PLAYER 3 marks this as a Pop'n 9-key chart. The engine routes channels
* 11..19 to slots 1..9 (no scratch) and binds them to Z/S/X/D/C/F/V/G/B
* respectively. Channel 17 carries an actual lane note in 9-key (NOT a
* free zone), so LNs authored on it stay scorable.

#PLAYER 3
#LNTYPE 1
#LNMODE 1
#LNOBJ ZZ

